// propgrid.kwxts — kwxTypeScript port of wxSamples/src/propgrid/propgrid.cpp
//
// The frame, menu tree, status bar, log window, panel, buttons, all three
// property-grid pages, the XRC frame, the popup, the minimal sample, the custom
// multi-button editor (kwxPGTextCtrlEditor) and the custom page
// (kwxPropertyGridPage) are reproduced.  wxPropertyGridInterface is a mixin on
// the grid/manager/page wrappers, so Insert/DeleteProperty/ReplaceProperty/
// SetPropertyCell/SetPropertyImage/SetPropertyMaxLength/read-only/hide/
// save-restore/Get-SetPropertyValues are called directly on those objects.
//
// Property classes that have no binding at all (wxSystemColourProperty,
// wxCursorProperty, wxPGChoices choice colours/bitmaps, wxFontDataProperty,
// wxDirsProperty, wxArrayDoubleProperty, wxVectorProperty, wxTriangleProperty,
// wxSizeProperty, wxPointProperty, MyColourProperty, SingleChoiceProperty) use
// the closest bound equivalent and are listed in the port report.
//
// Run from the repository root:
//   bin\Release\kwxts.exe samples\propgrid\propgrid.kwxts

